{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You finally found the ancient temple of <i>Quetzalcoatl</i>. There is a problem though, It's protected by a curse. Anyone that enters is stuck in a loop and can't ever escape. Fortunately, you found an old note of an adventurer that might have figured how to break the spell. However, as you found the note right next to their remains, it's probably not going to be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you will need to find 5 golden skulls. But be careful, some of them are cursed.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If everything is exactly as it should be, you can safely take the skull.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If anything is wrong in the temple, do NOT grab the skull</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let this distract you from the deadly traps all around the temple, any mistake would be fatal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exit 8-like</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online coop multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short runs, ideal for short sessions with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200 unique anomalies</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3993250?t=1759191000","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993250/e8e18b1e3bab77f06034632ca7f2c60240887575/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759191000","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993250/d0fc24fe8e93388ae9612e5b81f557f4a08b9510/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759191000","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993250/d0fc24fe8e93388ae9612e5b81f557f4a08b9510/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759191000","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You finally found the ancient temple of <i>Quetzalcoatl</i>. There is a problem though, It's protected by a curse. Anyone that enters is stuck in a loop and can't ever escape. Fortunately, you found an old note of an adventurer that might have figured how to break the spell. However, as you found the note right next to their remains, it's probably not going to be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you will need to find 5 golden skulls. But be careful, some of them are cursed.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If everything is exactly as it should be, you can safely take the skull.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If anything is wrong in the temple, do NOT grab the skull</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let this distract you from the deadly traps all around the temple, any mistake would be fatal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exit 8-like</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online coop multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short runs, ideal for short sessions with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200 unique anomalies</p></li></ul>","developers":["YorshInGame"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993250/33f2eaee1d9d315906b47febc7c4c0d40ad9469e/header.jpg?t=1759191000","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3993250/1900465603/8fec8596d11fda6236a36271ab480037a36ddd92/1759190165/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759190998","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3993250/1900465603/8fec8596d11fda6236a36271ab480037a36ddd92/1759190165/dash_h264.mpd?t=175919